A||N||47||Seanh||Fieros in Movies (Making list for my webpage)||||1||
Z||000000||Seanh||01-28-2001||10:55 AM||||Okay, I have seem quite a few postes over my time here about Fieros in movies. When ever I see one I usally try to watch the movie just to see it. So, I thought just for the heck of it, I would make a page on my website listing all the fiero movie sightings. I know there are tons I am forgetting, but here is what comes to mind right now:<P>"Big Trouble in little China" (Unknown model)<P>"Gone in 60 Seconds" (STDII)Maroon, Highway jump sceen. Its one of the cars involved in the accident. (Maybe we could get him another Fiero?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<P>"Friday" (unknow model)Areo nose, Black with Silver Ground FX<P>"Ferris Buellar's Day Off" Sister had a white 2m4, 84 or 85.<P>"Home alone 2: Lost in New York" When the wet bandits are walking across the street and see the kid, walk by a Black notchback, unsure of year.<P>"Independance Day" Show the lower, front end of a red coupe, 14" wheels.<P>"Wayne's World" Gold GT. Playing Street hockey, first time they yell "Car" and it drives by.<P>"The Favour" Red GT<P>"Magnolia" Silver Coupe or White Areo Notchback?<P>"Copland" Red Coupe<P>"Primal Fear" Black coupe appears twice<P>"Naked Gun 2 1/2" Prototype Solar car in wherehouse is a GT<P>"(Unknown Movie)" it's about a new guy(the divorce lawyer from LA Law) taking over a sperm bank run by Shelly Long. There's a good scene with 2 guys roaring around in a red GT with tan int.<P>"Metro" Eddie Murphy passes a Black notchback on the freeway twice. First 5 minutes of the movie.<P>"View to a Kill" Roger Moore as 007. Red Coupe.<P>"Star Trek IV" White coupe in background while walking thru the city.<P>"The Mod Squad" Gold SE in car wash scene.<P>"U.S. Marshalls" White Notchback in Gravyard fight scene.<P>"House Guest" Red, unknown model and year.<P>"Army Of One" Ferrari F40, Fiero Rebody.<P>"Malibu Express" 2m4 with NOS, Racing a Delorian in first 5 min.<P>"Cobra" Red 84 Coupe, chasing a sedan.<P>"The Rock" Yellow Ferrari 355 Fiero Rebody.<P>"Lucky Numbers" 87GT<P>"Whatever It Takes" Hes walking across a street with a Red Coupe behind him.<P>Thats all I know of, please post some more if you know of them. I found the one ID4 and 60 sec.<BR>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">       <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto (3.4 Conversion in Progress)<BR><I>"It's always in the last place you look." Of course it is. Why would you keep looking after you've found it? Do people do this? Who and where are they?</I><P>EDIT: Added all the new ones. Thanks<p>[This message has been edited by Seanh (edited 02-02-2001).]||||reg||1
